Challenge and proposed Evaluate change
Before: 51 carries a review packet and learning cautions forward without specifying how Evaluate must adjudicate each proposed conclusion.
After: require an external claim ledger identifying the exact claim, relevant evidence stream, candidate revision, observation, source of wording, assistance, rival explanation, missing coverage and permissible conclusion. Distinguish absent evidence from observed difficulty and from behavior not elicited. No aggregate success judgment, score or proficiency label follows. This adds an Evaluate requirement; no supplied finding invalidates an earlier artifact.

